  <!-- Checks the economy's game-free parts outside the game: the credit rating's arithmetic, the lending terms and the
       phone's fee, the credit file's cap and folding, its line in the save across versions, how the game's loans
       are told apart, and (Checks2.cs) the credit products, what happens when payments are missed, consolidation,
       the lender of last resort and the ways out of debt, and (Checks3.cs) the city's economy: twenty years of the model
       from many seeds, the central bank's rule, the adjustments, the rate the credit side reads and the save's line,
       and (Checks5.cs) running a business: staff, insurance, marketing, tax and the accountant, cash off the books,
       licences and its line in the save, and (RotaChecks.cs) the staff rota planner: the rota itself, the hours worth
       opening and the people a week takes, and (TableChecks.cs) the table model every app's table is ordered,
       filtered and summed by, and the categories of the cash flow.
       Compiles the mod's own files, so it checks exactly what ships.
       the lender of last resort and the ways out of debt, and (VenturesChecks.cs) investors, the pitch, deals and the
       stock market. Compiles the mod's own files, so it checks exactly what ships.
       Run: dotnet run -c Release (from this folder). Exit code 0 = all checks passed. -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>disable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>disable</ImplicitUsings>
    <RootNamespace>RealLifeOverhaul</RootNamespace>
